    "turn_idx": 8,
    "turn_text": "Yeah, I don't think people realize just how much innovation happens in these cities that are, I guess, what is called the flyover states. And I spent a lot of time in Pittsburgh, and that's how I became an angel, was at an angel group in Pittsburgh. And I was just fascinated at the amount of innovation that was happening right in my own",
