        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Testimonies from individuals with lived experience carry significant persuasive value in shaping public and legislative opinion.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker trusts the credibility of their peer, Eli Velasquez, as a representative of marginalized voices in finance.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "There is a moral imperative to ensure broader participation in investment opportunities regardless of wealth level.",
        "confidence": 0.88
